<Layout
  title="About · TuanChaYe"
  description="About TuanChaYe: a Chinese-tea knowledge platform for global readers."
>
  <div class="page-hero">
    <h1>About TuanChaYe</h1>
  </div>

  <p>
    TuanChaYe (团茶叶) is a Chinese-tea knowledge platform created for global
